{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52153","headline":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 九 · 许敬宗","name":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初芳候律，新𠯴谐音\n罄喧浮泗，弦静淄林。\n珪{石|彐/止}炫目，璧水澄心。\n蘂飘蹊霭，叶满帷深。\n（其九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}